<title>UK: LME approves Taiwan aluminium alloy brand.</title>
<headline>LME approves Taiwan aluminium alloy brand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) has approved the YG aluminium alloy brand of Taiwan producers Chen Jung Metal Material Co Ltd whose refinery produces 36,000 tonnes a year.</p>
<p>The brand will constitute good delivery against LME contracts with immediate effect, an LME notice said.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
